WEBVTT

STYLE
::cue(c.color9CD5FF) { color: #9CD5FF; }

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.000 line:5% align:center
<b><c.color9CD5FF>One Pace Addon</c></b>

2
00:01:49.710 --> 00:01:57.510
<b>ODEN WAS MEANT TO BOIL</b>

3
00:02:15.020 --> 00:02:18.480
I had hoped to
avoid a battle like this.

4
00:02:18.860 --> 00:02:18.890
Why were they
so thoroughly prepared?

5
00:02:18.890 --> 00:02:21.240
Why are they
so thoroughly prepared?

6
00:02:21.240 --> 00:02:23.980
How did they know
we were coming?

7
00:02:24.020 --> 00:02:26.570
Perhaps I have
a spy within your castle walls.

8
00:02:26.570 --> 00:02:30.980
Perhaps I have a spy
within your castle walls.

9
00:02:34.000 --> 00:02:36.040
Since I've just
had my mansion built,

10
00:02:36.040 --> 00:02:38.840
I'd rather not have it
turned into a battleground.

11
00:02:38.840 --> 00:02:42.920
So I came all the way out here
to meet you instead.

12
00:02:43.560 --> 00:02:43.750
Were you just telling me a lie
to keep me pacified?

13
00:02:43.750 --> 00:02:47.230
Were you just telling me
a lie to keep me pacified?

14
00:02:47.230 --> 00:02:48.960
Answer me!

15
00:02:48.960 --> 00:02:49.270
How clever!
A little late though!

16
00:02:49.270 --> 00:02:54.260
How clever.
A little late, though.

17
00:02:54.260 --> 00:02:58.140
Back then, we sensed we
were at a major disadvantage.

18
00:02:58.600 --> 00:03:00.270
You had just come back home,

19
00:03:00.270 --> 00:03:02.770
and we feared if you
joined forces with Hyogoro,

20
00:03:02.770 --> 00:03:06.400
we'd have to deal with the
samurai and yakuza together.

21
00:03:06.940 --> 00:03:09.650
Considering we had fewer
numbers at that time,

22
00:03:09.650 --> 00:03:09.890
it would have been
an uphill battle for our side,

23
00:03:09.890 --> 00:03:12.110
it would have been
an uphill battle for our side.

24
00:03:12.110 --> 00:03:12.300
especially if you lived up to
your fearsome reputation

25
00:03:12.300 --> 00:03:15.240
Especially if you lived up to
your fearsome reputation

26
00:03:15.240 --> 00:03:15.480
as a madman who
doesn't blink at sacrifice.

27
00:03:15.480 --> 00:03:18.730
as a madman who doesn't
blink at sacrifice.

28
00:03:20.750 --> 00:03:24.070
Only a fool would
rush into those circumstances.

29
00:03:24.070 --> 00:03:27.780
Luckily for us, you took
Orochi's words at face value,

30
00:03:27.780 --> 00:03:31.010
and chose the path where you
thought no one would get hurt.

31
00:03:31.010 --> 00:03:35.840
Newgate and Roger were cut from
the same pathetic cloth as you.

32
00:03:36.390 --> 00:03:40.310
Mighty pirates,
but softness is a weakness!

33
00:03:40.310 --> 00:03:41.730
Look what you've become!

34
00:03:41.730 --> 00:03:44.520
A fool who chose to dance!

35
00:03:44.850 --> 00:03:48.480
Stripped to your loincloth
and mocked by all!

36
00:03:51.570 --> 00:03:53.820
You've whittled away
what little dignity

37
00:03:53.820 --> 00:03:56.700
the Kozuki Clan had left!

38
00:04:04.920 --> 00:04:08.630
I still stand by my decision
that I made that day.

39
00:04:08.630 --> 00:04:11.850
We're here to speak of
the future, though!

40
00:04:37.570 --> 00:04:40.290
I never realized
how tough samurai could be!

41
00:04:40.290 --> 00:04:41.200
Don't wuss out!

42
00:04:41.200 --> 00:04:44.670
We have the advantage
with our numbers!

43
00:04:45.290 --> 00:04:47.420
Follow me! Onward!

44
00:04:47.420 --> 00:04:50.510
Hurry! Follow Lord Oden!

45
00:05:03.150 --> 00:05:05.240
I gotcha now!

46
00:05:08.030 --> 00:05:09.360
What was that?

47
00:05:10.370 --> 00:05:11.950
Who's there?

48
00:05:12.330 --> 00:05:14.910
I hope you don't mind me
stepping in to help a bit.

49
00:05:14.910 --> 00:05:18.500
It is sudden. And you probably
don't remember me.

50
00:05:18.500 --> 00:05:21.670
I served Lord Sukiyaki
when he was alive.

51
00:05:21.670 --> 00:05:25.340
You're Shinobu
from the ninja legion.

52
00:05:26.510 --> 00:05:29.010
Yes! That would be me!

53
00:05:29.010 --> 00:05:33.060
What happened to the others?
Why are you here alone?

54
00:05:33.970 --> 00:05:36.350
It's only me, unfortunately.

55
00:05:36.350 --> 00:05:40.060
Fukurokuju chose to
ally himself with Orochi.

56
00:05:40.860 --> 00:05:42.480
I cannot fault him
for losing faith

57
00:05:42.480 --> 00:05:45.360
in a foolish lord
such as myself.

58
00:05:47.860 --> 00:05:49.160
Long have I dreamed of the day

59
00:05:49.160 --> 00:05:51.530
that you take over
as Shogun, my lord!

60
00:05:51.530 --> 00:05:53.780
I am loyal to Kozukis!

61
00:05:55.470 --> 00:05:56.580
Know we walk a path
of thorns, Shinobu!

62
00:05:56.580 --> 00:06:00.670
I'm well aware of that!
I devote myself entirely!

63
00:06:00.670 --> 00:06:03.700
Let's press onward!

64
00:06:10.240 --> 00:06:12.450
A messenger delivered
an unsettling letter

65
00:06:12.450 --> 00:06:13.830
from your husband.

66
00:06:13.830 --> 00:06:16.500
It read, "My wife and
children are in danger.

67
00:06:16.500 --> 00:06:18.040
Please save them."

68
00:06:18.040 --> 00:06:22.130
Dropkick, go!

69
00:06:23.630 --> 00:06:26.180
Ha? Hey! How dare you!

70
00:06:26.180 --> 00:06:27.500
Come back!

71
00:06:27.500 --> 00:06:27.800
Momono...er, rather, Lord
Momonosuke, is already eight.

72
00:06:27.800 --> 00:06:32.020
Momono...or rather, Lord
Momonosuke, is already eight.

73
00:06:32.430 --> 00:06:32.550
My lady, we should
prepare for the worst.

74
00:06:32.550 --> 00:06:36.510
My lady. We should
prepare for the worst.

75
00:06:37.430 --> 00:06:37.520
Oden's defeat would be
more than a simple setback.

76
00:06:37.520 --> 00:06:39.020
Oden's defeat would mean more

77
00:06:39.020 --> 00:06:41.190
than a simple setback.

78
00:06:42.820 --> 00:06:43.010
It would be
the end of our country.

79
00:06:43.010 --> 00:06:45.810
It would be the end
of our country.

80
00:06:47.180 --> 00:06:48.600
Oden.

81
00:06:55.280 --> 00:06:56.570
First unit here!

82
00:06:56.570 --> 00:06:57.820
They were too much for us!

83
00:06:59.950 --> 00:07:01.370
Sorry, sir!

84
00:07:01.370 --> 00:07:04.500
We never imagined Kozuki Oden
would be this strong!

85
00:07:05.290 --> 00:07:07.370
What a bunch of weaklings!

86
00:07:07.370 --> 00:07:10.040
Thousands of troops
versus 11 samurai.

87
00:07:10.040 --> 00:07:11.630
And they still can't cut it!

88
00:07:11.630 --> 00:07:14.000
How are they giving them
this much trouble?

89
00:07:14.000 --> 00:07:16.720
It's too pathetic to watch.

90
00:07:17.510 --> 00:07:22.140
Let me handle it.

91
00:08:02.020 --> 00:08:04.380
Kozuki Oden!

92
00:08:06.480 --> 00:08:10.340
I've been waiting
to meet someone like you.

93
00:08:34.410 --> 00:08:34.660
<b>Halcyon</b>

94
00:08:34.660 --> 00:08:34.870
<b>Halcyon Totsuka</b>

95
00:08:49.850 --> 00:08:54.020
That bastard actually
landed a hit on Commander Kaido?

96
00:10:08.110 --> 00:10:10.860
My lord, I failed you.

97
00:10:21.300 --> 00:10:24.560
And thus ends the
final battle of Kozuki Oden,

98
00:10:24.560 --> 00:10:27.300
who collapsed in defeat
beside his loyal retainers.

99
00:10:27.300 --> 00:10:29.420
After they are
defeated in combat

100
00:10:35.530 --> 00:10:37.740
The battle between
the Beast Pirates and samurai

101
00:10:37.740 --> 00:10:41.620
was so intense that it set
the forests of Udon ablaze.

102
00:10:41.620 --> 00:10:44.160
In fact, the inferno
did not die down until

103
00:10:44.160 --> 00:10:47.630
rain fell upon the land
a full five days later.

104
00:10:50.350 --> 00:10:51.520
– Mother!
– Mother!

105
00:10:53.690 --> 00:10:56.280
Do you think Father
will be home soon?

106
00:10:56.280 --> 00:10:58.610
I made a toy for him,
did you see?

107
00:10:58.610 --> 00:11:01.030
My, would you look at that!

108
00:11:03.250 --> 00:11:05.580
I bet you miss your father!

109
00:11:05.580 --> 00:11:09.460
Of course! I can't wait
to play when he gets back!

110
00:11:17.180 --> 00:11:19.390
The Daimyo of Kuri,
Kozuki Oden,

111
00:11:19.390 --> 00:11:21.020
and his nine followers
were imprisoned

112
00:11:21.020 --> 00:11:22.640
in the Flower Capital.

113
00:11:22.640 --> 00:11:24.520
Now labeled criminals,

114
00:11:24.520 --> 00:11:26.640
they were to await
their death sentence

115
00:11:26.640 --> 00:11:29.110
for rebelling
against the shogun.

116
00:11:29.650 --> 00:11:31.820
Unaware of the reason
for their arrest,

117
00:11:31.820 --> 00:11:34.530
the population reacted coldly.

118
00:11:34.530 --> 00:11:36.070
Oden was a disappointment.

119
00:11:36.070 --> 00:11:37.490
It's too little too late.

120
00:11:37.490 --> 00:11:38.910
So, we don't even get to see

121
00:11:38.910 --> 00:11:40.660
his asine dance anymore?

122
00:11:40.660 --> 00:11:43.080
But that was the only thing
he was good for!

123
00:11:43.080 --> 00:11:44.790
Don't mock the simple-minded!

124
00:11:44.790 --> 00:11:47.040
Sorry, sorry!

125
00:11:51.400 --> 00:11:54.360
Hm? I've never seen this woman.

126
00:11:56.200 --> 00:11:59.200
How can someone I've
never met be my retainer?

127
00:11:59.530 --> 00:12:02.490
Are you making an attempt
on my life as well?

128
00:12:03.200 --> 00:12:04.950
Lord Oden?

129
00:12:04.950 --> 00:12:08.120
I don't know what your plan is!
But drop the act!

130
00:12:08.120 --> 00:12:10.750
Begone from my sight, kunoichi!

131
00:12:19.340 --> 00:12:21.220
Attention everyone!

132
00:12:21.220 --> 00:12:25.810
The sentences have been
decided for the samurai!

133
00:12:29.100 --> 00:12:31.690
The ten immoral
insurgents who dared to

134
00:12:31.690 --> 00:12:33.730
rise against the Shogun Orochi

135
00:12:33.730 --> 00:12:36.070
shall receive swift
and just punishment

136
00:12:36.070 --> 00:12:38.820
for their wicked transgressions.

137
00:12:40.410 --> 00:12:42.030
In 72 hours,

138
00:12:42.030 --> 00:12:44.580
the offenders
shall face execution

139
00:12:44.580 --> 00:12:47.660
by being boiled to death!

140
00:12:54.590 --> 00:12:57.090
Three days later.

141
00:12:59.760 --> 00:13:02.470
This isn't
something you get to see often!

142
00:13:02.470 --> 00:13:03.550
Since they're using hot oil,

143
00:13:03.550 --> 00:13:05.100
it won't take long!

144
00:13:05.100 --> 00:13:06.890
Then we'd better hurry!

145
00:13:07.930 --> 00:13:09.980
– No!

146
00:13:09.980 --> 00:13:12.480
It has yet to be
tasted for poison.

147
00:13:12.480 --> 00:13:14.110
Please allow me.

148
00:13:17.280 --> 00:13:18.980
Excuse me, Mother.

149
00:13:18.980 --> 00:13:20.490
I don't understand
why somebody would

150
00:13:20.490 --> 00:13:22.950
be after our family's lives.

151
00:13:23.310 --> 00:13:23.770
Your father's
a great man, Momonosuke.

152
00:13:23.770 --> 00:13:26.100
Your father's a great man.

153
00:13:26.100 --> 00:13:29.360
Momonosuke, one day,
you will rule this land.

154
00:13:29.360 --> 00:13:31.850
Then you'll understand.

155
00:13:31.850 --> 00:13:34.730
Here you go.
It's safe for consumption.

156
00:13:34.730 --> 00:13:39.780
Thank you so much for
the food! Are you okay?

157
00:13:43.910 --> 00:13:45.580
Mother!

158
00:13:48.710 --> 00:13:51.330
Mother. Be honest.

159
00:13:55.500 --> 00:13:58.260
No. Why?

160
00:14:03.240 --> 00:14:05.110
The public
execution of the rebellious

161
00:14:05.110 --> 00:14:07.120
Kozuki Oden and
his nine retainers

162
00:14:07.120 --> 00:14:09.580
shall begin momentarily!

163
00:14:13.500 --> 00:14:14.790
Despite his best efforts,

164
00:14:14.790 --> 00:14:16.800
he couldn't take down Kaido.

165
00:14:16.800 --> 00:14:18.130
He might have been a fool,

166
00:14:18.130 --> 00:14:20.720
but he was pretty tough
when it came down to it.

167
00:14:21.720 --> 00:14:23.010
I dunno.

168
00:14:23.010 --> 00:14:25.510
Look where his strength
landed him.

169
00:14:43.580 --> 00:14:45.860
Give me a chance to live.

170
00:14:46.160 --> 00:14:49.700
I must... I must live!

171
00:14:49.700 --> 00:14:52.870
How dare you?
I make the calls around here!

172
00:14:55.080 --> 00:14:57.660
It's too late to start
begging for your life.

173
00:14:57.660 --> 00:14:59.620
Now, get in the pot.

174
00:15:01.090 --> 00:15:05.170
H-Help me!

175
00:15:14.520 --> 00:15:17.910
All ten of us will
enter the pot together.

176
00:15:20.290 --> 00:15:20.440
We'll attempt to
withstand it for an agreed time.

177
00:15:20.440 --> 00:15:23.400
We'll attempt to withstand it
for an agreed time.

178
00:15:23.400 --> 00:15:25.750
Whoever survives may go.

179
00:15:26.840 --> 00:15:28.840
Do we have a deal?

180
00:15:40.570 --> 00:15:42.450
Are you stupid?

181
00:15:42.450 --> 00:15:45.370
The oil's going to
kill you instantly!

182
00:15:53.170 --> 00:15:57.130
You think you've got
a chance? You're crazy!

183
00:16:00.050 --> 00:16:02.050
This is too pathetic to watch.

184
00:16:02.050 --> 00:16:04.260
Seems Oden has
stooped to a new low.

185
00:16:04.260 --> 00:16:07.600
All right.
Someone fetch me a timer.

186
00:16:07.600 --> 00:16:09.180
Yes, sir!

187
00:16:10.020 --> 00:16:12.230
Kaido? Are you sure?

188
00:16:15.170 --> 00:16:19.420
Just trust me.

189
00:16:20.600 --> 00:16:23.650
Looks like this is your
chance to make history!

190
00:16:23.650 --> 00:16:23.740
Let's see how long you last!

191
00:16:23.740 --> 00:16:27.740
Let's see how long
you last.

192
00:16:30.360 --> 00:16:32.540
I'll give you one hour.

193
00:16:32.540 --> 00:16:34.170
Y'think you can hold out?

194
00:16:34.170 --> 00:16:37.540
That's too long,
even for a normal bath!

195
00:16:39.590 --> 00:16:44.220
A fool
till the end, I see!

196
00:16:44.220 --> 00:16:46.140
Do I have your word?

197
00:16:46.140 --> 00:16:48.350
Of course you do.

198
00:16:50.140 --> 00:16:53.560
Please, talk to us
first! Come back!

199
00:16:53.560 --> 00:16:55.560
Please, we beg you!

200
00:17:10.120 --> 00:17:11.540
Lord Oden.

201
00:17:11.540 --> 00:17:13.660
He survived?

202
00:17:16.500 --> 00:17:18.580
Do not
let him suffer on his own!

203
00:17:19.600 --> 00:17:21.690
We must follow our lord!

204
00:17:21.690 --> 00:17:25.280
We shall meet again
in the next world! Farewell!

205
00:17:26.720 --> 00:17:28.510
– Right!
– Right!

206
00:17:36.040 --> 00:17:40.540
Balance yourselves
on this plank. All of you!

207
00:17:52.840 --> 00:17:55.140
What are you doing,
my lord? Stop!

208
00:18:03.060 --> 00:18:06.480
We're ready to die!
Please, my lord!

209
00:18:10.400 --> 00:18:12.030
This is cruel!

210
00:18:12.030 --> 00:18:15.330
It's a disgrace
to live on without you!

211
00:18:15.330 --> 00:18:17.830
My lord, we should be
holding you-gara up!

212
00:18:17.830 --> 00:18:18.960
Please, switch with me!

213
00:18:18.960 --> 00:18:20.870
You should allow me
to go in your stead!

214
00:18:20.870 --> 00:18:24.340
Please, Lord Oden!

215
00:18:24.340 --> 00:18:28.840
Shut up and stay put!
That's an order!

216
00:18:28.840 --> 00:18:32.300
But our duty as your retainers
should be to protect you!

217
00:18:32.300 --> 00:18:34.890
Do not start questioning me!

218
00:18:37.970 --> 00:18:39.850
Huh?! That filthy cheater!

219
00:18:39.850 --> 00:18:44.230
His damn retainers
aren't even touching the oil!

220
00:18:45.670 --> 00:18:48.980
Well, I have to
hand it to him.

221
00:18:48.980 --> 00:18:51.780
All ten are in the pot.

222
00:18:53.570 --> 00:18:57.620
Clever, Oden. Fair enough.

223
00:19:01.620 --> 00:19:04.630
All right!
Let's start the clock!

224
00:19:09.790 --> 00:19:15.300
This isn't fair!
Please, my lord, let us down!

225
00:19:22.390 --> 00:19:26.680
Think you'll last? It hasn't
even been a full minute yet.

226
00:19:33.980 --> 00:19:38.320
He's still standing.
His skin is tough.

227
00:19:41.700 --> 00:19:45.160
I fear I may
faint from this heat alone.

228
00:19:45.160 --> 00:19:46.240
I can't take it!

229
00:19:46.240 --> 00:19:48.580
You-gara have no right
to complain!

230
00:19:48.580 --> 00:19:51.870
So suck it up, Raizo! Sit still!

231
00:19:51.870 --> 00:19:53.830
You-gara have it easy!

232
00:19:54.710 --> 00:19:56.500
Stop your wiggling, cat!

233
00:19:56.500 --> 00:19:59.380
We have to stay
balanced up here!

234
00:20:10.770 --> 00:20:13.600
Man, I thought they were
supposed to burn up instantly.

235
00:20:13.600 --> 00:20:15.310
This is taking too long.

236
00:20:15.310 --> 00:20:17.150
Shouldn't there
be more pain and suffering?

237
00:20:17.150 --> 00:20:19.900
How's this supposed
to be entertaining?

238
00:20:21.360 --> 00:20:24.570
Would you hurry up already?
You damn fool!

239
00:20:24.570 --> 00:20:27.160
We're sick of you! Just end it!

240
00:20:33.960 --> 00:20:36.210
Are you calling Oden a fool?

241
00:20:36.210 --> 00:20:39.380
If you do that again,
I'll end you.

242
00:20:39.380 --> 00:20:42.970
I'm sorry!

243
00:20:42.970 --> 00:20:44.800
Whoa, what is she gonna do?

244
00:20:44.800 --> 00:20:47.430
She's seriously gonna
cut that guy!

245
00:20:47.430 --> 00:20:49.770
Is she a kunoichi?

246
00:20:52.020 --> 00:20:54.060
Do you see? Shinobu!

247
00:20:54.060 --> 00:20:58.320
What is this about?
Why has she revealed herself?

248
00:20:59.230 --> 00:21:03.160
I should cut that tongue
out of your head!

249
00:21:05.160 --> 00:21:07.370
You don't know the truth!

250
00:21:14.080 --> 00:21:17.380
The only fool here is you!

251
00:21:18.950 --> 00:21:21.920
You live in peace,
and none of you know why!

252
00:21:21.920 --> 00:21:25.040
Who the hell do you
think ensured that?

253
00:21:25.970 --> 00:21:28.800
Pray that we don't
lose Lord Oden today!

254
00:21:28.800 --> 00:21:31.810
You don't know
the burden he carries!

255
00:21:31.810 --> 00:21:35.900
You'll soon understand how much
suffering he's kept at bay!

256
00:21:39.270 --> 00:21:40.690
Listen to me!

257
00:21:40.690 --> 00:21:43.900
Orochi never wanted
to be shogun!

258
00:21:43.900 --> 00:21:45.360
It's hard to believe,

259
00:21:45.360 --> 00:21:48.570
but he had no intention
of ruling Wano!

260
00:22:02.150 --> 00:22:04.780
Every last person
in this damned country

261
00:22:04.780 --> 00:22:07.410
mistreated the Kurozumi Clan!

262
00:22:07.410 --> 00:22:09.700
They're all guilty
of persecution!

263
00:22:09.700 --> 00:22:12.120
They are all scum!

264
00:22:12.120 --> 00:22:16.880
I couldn't care less if
every last one of them dies!

265
00:22:16.880 --> 00:22:21.090
Would you like to know
why I became the shogun?

266
00:22:21.090 --> 00:22:25.180
Surprise, surprise!
To get my revenge!

267
00:22:25.180 --> 00:22:29.050
I'll send this country
straight to hell!

268
00:22:35.390 --> 00:22:37.140
My grandfather had a dream!

269
00:22:37.140 --> 00:22:40.400
He wanted to become
Shogun, you know!

270
00:22:40.400 --> 00:22:43.070
That was long before
you were born.

271
00:22:43.070 --> 00:22:45.150
He poisoned every
daimyo, one-by-one,

272
00:22:45.150 --> 00:22:46.820
before he was caught!

273
00:22:46.820 --> 00:22:51.660
Then the damn shogun
forced him to commit seppuku!

274
00:22:51.660 --> 00:22:53.740
Our clan lost its status.

275
00:22:53.740 --> 00:22:55.620
That's fair enough!

276
00:22:55.620 --> 00:22:59.580
But what happened next
was a living nightmare for us!

277
00:22:59.580 --> 00:23:01.580
It was senseless cruelty!

278
00:23:07.550 --> 00:23:09.430
The members of
our clan were chased down

279
00:23:09.430 --> 00:23:11.680
and terrorized by
complete strangers,

280
00:23:11.680 --> 00:23:15.060
who claimed they were taking
the law into their own hands!

281
00:23:15.060 --> 00:23:15.120
They beat us!
Threw us in the river!

282
00:23:15.120 --> 00:23:15.570
them.

283
00:23:18.980 --> 00:23:21.600
Struck us dead!

284
00:23:21.600 --> 00:23:24.070
I was so terrified
of this vigilante mob

285
00:23:24.070 --> 00:23:26.530
that I couldn't sleep at night!

286
00:23:29.400 --> 00:23:32.030
But my grandfather's
crime had been paid for!

287
00:23:32.030 --> 00:23:34.410
He was long dead!

288
00:23:34.410 --> 00:23:38.250
You'll pay, Kurozumi!
We'll kill you all!

289
00:23:46.760 --> 00:23:47.880
All this cruelty!

290
00:23:47.880 --> 00:23:52.220
Your bloodline is evil!
You're a daimyo-killer!

291
00:23:54.600 --> 00:23:56.480
It's not my fault!

292
00:23:56.480 --> 00:23:58.500
Blast Breath!

293
00:23:58.500 --> 00:24:00.710
"Doesn't matter
if you're a child!

294
00:24:00.710 --> 00:24:03.840
You're a criminal
if you're a Kurozumi!"

295
00:24:05.050 --> 00:24:08.930
You see why I seek
revenge now? Do you?

296
00:24:08.930 --> 00:24:12.930
Every last person in Wano
will feel my fury!

297
00:24:15.890 --> 00:24:20.640
What is this?

298
00:24:23.060 --> 00:24:26.060
You're a mad man.

299
00:24:28.690 --> 00:24:32.280
I am bringing them
the punishment they deserve!

300
00:24:34.950 --> 00:24:39.450
Orochi! What are you
planning to do with them?

301
00:24:39.450 --> 00:24:44.540
In another room,
Orochi was stockpiling weapons.

302
00:24:44.540 --> 00:24:48.210
Along with hundreds of people
who had been kidnapped!

303
00:24:51.920 --> 00:24:55.180
Once handed over,
their fate was sealed.

304
00:24:55.180 --> 00:24:58.300
Their very humanity
was taken from them.

305
00:25:02.020 --> 00:25:03.940
They became tributes.

306
00:25:03.940 --> 00:25:07.230
All given away to Kaido!

307
00:25:10.980 --> 00:25:13.440
Oh, those people?

308
00:25:13.440 --> 00:25:18.490
They'll be sold or tortured.
Some killed, perhaps.

309
00:25:21.330 --> 00:25:23.580
Lord Oden was furious!

310
00:25:23.580 --> 00:25:27.670
But Orochi stopped the conflict
by making a proposal.

311
00:25:28.070 --> 00:25:31.240
Do you want Wano to
go to war? Think, Oden!

312
00:25:34.080 --> 00:25:37.290
Or would you like
the kidnappings to stop?

313
00:25:37.290 --> 00:25:39.420
I'd choose wisely if I were you.

314
00:25:39.420 --> 00:25:42.250
There's a lot on the line here!

315
00:25:43.580 --> 00:25:45.160
He was driven by hate.

316
00:25:45.160 --> 00:25:47.290
A cruel act of vengeance.

317
00:25:47.290 --> 00:25:49.750
By our pain!

318
00:25:49.750 --> 00:25:52.210
Win or lose, Orochi would cause

319
00:25:52.210 --> 00:25:54.880
unspeakable suffering
to this country.

320
00:25:54.880 --> 00:25:57.010
Lord Oden's hand was forced.

321
00:25:57.010 --> 00:26:00.380
He had no other choice.

322
00:26:00.380 --> 00:26:02.550
He danced like a fool every week

323
00:26:02.550 --> 00:26:05.720
as an apology to
the Kurozumi Clan.

324
00:26:05.720 --> 00:26:08.690
He knew by doing so,
he would lose his standing!

325
00:26:08.690 --> 00:26:10.310
But that didn't matter!

326
00:26:10.310 --> 00:26:13.320
He could save 100 lives
with each dance!

327
00:26:21.620 --> 00:26:24.910
He trusted Orochi's
promise, that five years later,

328
00:26:24.910 --> 00:26:26.370
when their ships were finished,

329
00:26:26.370 --> 00:26:29.000
they would leave Wano
and never return.

330
00:26:29.000 --> 00:26:32.000
But he put too much
faith in them.

331
00:26:32.000 --> 00:26:34.000
He traveled region to region,

332
00:26:34.000 --> 00:26:37.920
every week ensuring that
everything was in order.

333
00:26:40.100 --> 00:26:45.980
The entire time, Lord Oden
has been protecting Wano!

334
00:26:40.310 --> 00:26:40.320
The entire time, Lord Oden
has been protecting Wano.

335
00:26:45.980 --> 00:26:45.990
So why don't you tell me again! So why don't you tell me again?

336
00:26:45.990 --> 00:26:48.290
So why don't you tell me again?

337
00:26:48.290 --> 00:26:51.740
Who are you calling a fool?!

338
00:27:22.110 --> 00:27:24.990
Lord Oden protected us,
but what're we supposed to do?

339
00:27:24.990 --> 00:27:26.660
Why would you tell us this now?

340
00:27:26.660 --> 00:27:29.450
All this is
way too hard to swallow!

341
00:27:30.400 --> 00:27:33.910
Let me go!

342
00:27:33.910 --> 00:27:34.660
the truth!

343
00:27:35.700 --> 00:27:38.870
The truth will only create
strife for this country.

344
00:27:38.870 --> 00:27:41.280
Go to hell!

345
00:27:41.280 --> 00:27:43.660
"A foolish lord rebelled
against the shogun,

346
00:27:43.660 --> 00:27:44.790
and was punished."

347
00:27:44.790 --> 00:27:46.500
That's what people will say.

348
00:27:46.500 --> 00:27:49.670
He'll be dead in moments,
and all will be settled.

349
00:27:50.540 --> 00:27:53.710
Surely you knew you would
face consequences.

350
00:27:53.710 --> 00:27:55.170
You think I'm afraid?

351
00:27:55.170 --> 00:27:57.550
I'm one of
Lord Oden's retainers!

352
00:27:57.550 --> 00:28:00.260
I share my fate with them!

353
00:28:00.260 --> 00:28:04.430
Why would I listen to
the barking of Orochi's dogs?

354
00:28:04.430 --> 00:28:06.930
I am prepared to die
beside my lord,

355
00:28:06.930 --> 00:28:09.180
but that doesn't mean
I'm giving up!

356
00:28:10.560 --> 00:28:13.270
You watch! All of us
will survive!

357
00:28:13.270 --> 00:28:17.110
And then we'll bring an end
to your treachery!

358
00:28:17.110 --> 00:28:20.240
Hmph! What a joke!

359
00:28:20.980 --> 00:28:24.740
Shogun, please! Stop the
execution! This isn't right!

360
00:28:28.370 --> 00:28:31.000
I beg of you, my lord!

361
00:28:32.620 --> 00:28:34.320
Please, my lord!

362
00:28:38.330 --> 00:28:40.500
Someone call a doctor!

363
00:28:48.800 --> 00:28:50.760
Orochi!

364
00:28:52.130 --> 00:28:54.300
They were nothing but scum.

365
00:28:54.300 --> 00:28:56.260
It was not only
the shogun's family

366
00:28:56.260 --> 00:28:58.600
who persecuted
the Kurozumi Clan,

367
00:28:58.600 --> 00:29:01.390
but the common people as well.

368
00:29:01.390 --> 00:29:04.480
So when Orochi turned
his ire upon them,

369
00:29:04.480 --> 00:29:06.770
they immediately realized
what kind of suffering

370
00:29:06.770 --> 00:29:11.650
his vengeance might
bring to the land.

371
00:29:11.650 --> 00:29:15.280
Meanwhile, thanks to
Shinobu's passionate words,

372
00:29:15.280 --> 00:29:17.490
the truth behind
Oden's naked dancing

373
00:29:17.490 --> 00:29:19.240
spread quickly
throughout the city,

374
00:29:19.240 --> 00:29:22.460
and the hearts of the people
began to change.

375
00:29:22.460 --> 00:29:26.840
What? Then he was the one
who saved us that day?

376
00:29:29.840 --> 00:29:31.920
We mocked him
for all those years!

377
00:29:31.920 --> 00:29:33.720
And he never said a word!

378
00:29:33.720 --> 00:29:35.430
He was suffering
more than anyone,

379
00:29:35.430 --> 00:29:37.640
and he carried that
all on his own!

380
00:29:37.640 --> 00:29:41.390
We're fools! What've we done?

381
00:29:42.730 --> 00:29:46.810
From all directions,
the citizens rushed to Oden.

382
00:29:46.810 --> 00:29:48.860
Knowing now that
the Daimyo of Kuri

383
00:29:48.860 --> 00:29:50.780
is not the fool they
thought he was,

384
00:29:50.780 --> 00:29:52.690
they were filled with regret.

385
00:29:52.690 --> 00:29:56.160
And as this brave samurai stood
before their eyes facing death,

386
00:29:56.160 --> 00:29:58.320
they realized that he was
the only hope left

387
00:29:58.320 --> 00:30:00.540
for the future of Wano.

388
00:30:03.000 --> 00:30:05.830
Lord Oden! You can't leave us!

389
00:30:05.830 --> 00:30:08.630
I'm sorry for every rotten
thing I said about you!

390
00:30:08.630 --> 00:30:11.710
Thank you for keeping everyone
safe all these years!

391
00:30:17.300 --> 00:30:19.510
It's far too late now!

392
00:30:19.510 --> 00:30:22.100
You buncha brown-nosers!

393
00:30:22.100 --> 00:30:23.430
Ignore them, and just...

394
00:30:23.430 --> 00:30:27.440
Thank you, everyone!
I shall give it my best!

395
00:30:27.440 --> 00:30:29.520
He's so honorable!

396
00:30:31.520 --> 00:30:34.280
Far from being
moved by their pleas,

397
00:30:34.280 --> 00:30:35.780
Orochi could not
let the people's

398
00:30:35.780 --> 00:30:39.160
sudden support of Oden
go unpunished.

399
00:30:39.160 --> 00:30:40.660
Before they knew it,

400
00:30:40.660 --> 00:30:43.410
they were surrounded by Kaido
and Orochi's subordinates.

401
00:30:43.410 --> 00:30:45.000
Swords at their back,

402
00:30:45.000 --> 00:30:48.830
they could only stare upon
the cruel execution in terror.

403
00:30:50.330 --> 00:30:52.500
The temperature
of the oil rose above

404
00:30:52.500 --> 00:30:56.220
a thousand degrees
and continued to climb.

405
00:31:02.940 --> 00:31:05.570
Swift arrows
carried news of the events

406
00:31:03.930 --> 00:31:07.470
<b>Kibi</b>
<b>Flower 
Capital</b>
<b>Kuri</b>

407
00:31:03.930 --> 00:31:07.450
<b>Ringo</b>
<b>Udon</b>
<b>Hakumai</b>

408
00:31:05.570 --> 00:31:08.030
to the leaders of each region.

409
00:31:07.760 --> 00:31:09.930
<b>Hakumai


Wano</b>

410
00:31:13.830 --> 00:31:15.450
The letter-arrows of Wano

411
00:31:15.450 --> 00:31:19.290
fly great distances
with extreme accuracy.

412
00:31:24.320 --> 00:31:25.360
Listen well!

413
00:31:27.600 --> 00:31:31.650
If I survive this
execution by some means,

414
00:31:31.650 --> 00:31:34.820
I will change this country!

415
00:31:34.820 --> 00:31:38.490
I will open up
the Land of Wano to the world!

416
00:31:41.410 --> 00:31:44.530
What are those idiots
babbling about over there?

417
00:31:44.530 --> 00:31:47.240
You have said before that
the borders of this land

418
00:31:47.240 --> 00:31:48.870
should be opened again.

419
00:31:48.870 --> 00:31:52.210
And yet, you also said
that our policy of isolation

420
00:31:52.210 --> 00:31:54.460
is tied to the Kozuki Clan.

421
00:31:54.460 --> 00:31:57.590
When you traveled the seas
with Whitebeard and Roger,

422
00:31:57.590 --> 00:32:01.470
what secrets of the world
did you uncover?

423
00:32:03.280 --> 00:32:05.010
Many years ago,

424
00:32:05.010 --> 00:32:06.890
the ones who decided
that this country

425
00:32:06.890 --> 00:32:13.270
should close its borders
were indeed the Kozuki Clan.

426
00:32:13.270 --> 00:32:15.770
They sought to
protect the Land of Wano

427
00:32:15.770 --> 00:32:19.070
from an outside force
of overwhelming might.

428
00:32:19.070 --> 00:32:23.160
But now, this country...
or rather, the world...

429
00:32:23.160 --> 00:32:26.700
awaits the arrival of
a figure of great importance.

430
00:32:28.120 --> 00:32:31.000
Once the promised
800 years have passed,

431
00:32:31.000 --> 00:32:32.750
they will appear.

432
00:32:32.750 --> 00:32:35.960
And when they do, this country
must be welcoming to them,

433
00:32:35.960 --> 00:32:38.880
and ready to work by their side.

434
00:32:40.690 --> 00:32:46.150
I will be
clear with you.

435
00:32:48.930 --> 00:32:52.640
Today will not be a victory.

436
00:32:52.640 --> 00:32:55.860
For I am certain that
they are going to kill me.

437
00:32:58.270 --> 00:33:00.780
My lord! Stop it!

438
00:33:00.780 --> 00:33:03.360
You have the strength
to survive this!

439
00:33:03.400 --> 00:33:05.820
A third of the time
has already passed!

440
00:33:06.190 --> 00:33:08.980
Take up the cause in my stead!

441
00:33:10.190 --> 00:33:13.480
You must open the Land of Wano!

442
00:33:14.420 --> 00:33:18.300
We'll do it, but we'll
do it by your side!

443
00:33:18.300 --> 00:33:20.010
We have heard your dream.

444
00:33:20.010 --> 00:33:24.940
And it shall be
our dream as well!

445
00:33:24.940 --> 00:33:27.520
Well spoken, my friend!

446
00:33:31.780 --> 00:33:34.780
All right! Thirty minutes to go!

447
00:33:36.630 --> 00:33:39.430
The boiling oil
that cooked Oden's flesh

448
00:33:39.430 --> 00:33:41.220
created a living hell.

449
00:33:41.220 --> 00:33:43.930
Not only for him,
but his retainers.

450
00:33:46.860 --> 00:33:48.960
This is absurd!

451
00:33:48.960 --> 00:33:52.420
Hurry! Raise the
temperature, you dolts!

452
00:34:05.150 --> 00:34:08.320
Ugh. Why in the hell
are you so tough?

453
00:34:08.320 --> 00:34:10.830
Burn already!

454
00:34:44.390 --> 00:34:48.930
It's a miracle!
He survived the execution!

455
00:34:50.810 --> 00:34:52.140
He'll walk free!

456
00:34:52.140 --> 00:34:56.320
Lord Oden is too tough to boil!

457
00:34:56.320 --> 00:34:58.820
He did it!

458
00:35:02.020 --> 00:35:04.310
And his name has been
cleared as well!

459
00:35:04.310 --> 00:35:06.520
The citizens will surely
take his side

460
00:35:06.520 --> 00:35:08.730
now that they know the truth!

461
00:35:08.730 --> 00:35:11.520
Ready for a fight? Eh, Kaido?

462
00:35:11.520 --> 00:35:13.440
Don't taunt him, stupid cat!

463
00:35:13.440 --> 00:35:15.900
Why not? We won, didn't we?

464
00:35:23.640 --> 00:35:24.200
I changed
my mind a minute ago

465
00:35:24.200 --> 00:35:25.790
I changed my mind
a minute ago

466
00:35:25.790 --> 00:35:28.330
and decided to go with
death by firing squad

467
00:35:28.330 --> 00:35:29.960
instead of the other deal!

468
00:35:31.260 --> 00:35:31.300
And Oden's not the only
one we're executing!

469
00:35:31.300 --> 00:35:34.430
And Oden's not
the only one we're executing!

470
00:35:34.430 --> 00:35:34.470
His entire family will
be killed as well!

471
00:35:34.470 --> 00:35:37.480
His entire family
will be killed as well!

472
00:35:41.010 --> 00:35:43.390
A childish excuse from a coward!

473
00:35:43.390 --> 00:35:46.600
That's not what you promised,
Lord Oden fought and...

474
00:35:52.170 --> 00:35:54.780
If you got
a problem, then step up!

475
00:35:54.780 --> 00:35:56.860
We got plenty of
bullets to go around!

476
00:36:03.950 --> 00:36:08.130
I'm counting on you!
Make me proud!

477
00:36:08.130 --> 00:36:12.140
You must open up
the Land of Wano!

478
00:36:33.560 --> 00:36:36.060
Onward! To Kuri!

479
00:36:40.070 --> 00:36:44.410
Shinobu!

480
00:36:46.580 --> 00:36:49.450
Do not look back!

481
00:36:53.020 --> 00:36:54.290
Kozuki

482
00:36:54.290 --> 00:36:57.150
– Kozuki Oden!
– Kozuki Oden!

483
00:36:57.150 --> 00:36:57.250
Pardon me, but I couldn't help
but overhear what you just said.

484
00:36:57.250 --> 00:36:59.380
Pardon me, I couldn't
help but overhear

485
00:36:59.380 --> 00:37:00.760
what you just said.

486
00:37:03.220 --> 00:37:08.850
Kill them! Kill them all!

487
00:37:10.310 --> 00:37:11.810
After them!

488
00:37:11.810 --> 00:37:15.830
Kill every last member
of the Kozuki Clan!

489
00:37:15.830 --> 00:37:18.170
No matter what happens next,

490
00:37:18.170 --> 00:37:20.790
your body's already
damaged beyond repair.

491
00:37:20.790 --> 00:37:23.000
I'll give you a parting gift.

492
00:37:23.000 --> 00:37:25.880
A nice bullet to the head.

493
00:37:26.840 --> 00:37:30.680
Seems the era of Kozuki
is over for good.

494
00:37:30.680 --> 00:37:33.510
All of you are dead!

495
00:37:33.510 --> 00:37:38.930
You have underestimated
my samurai, Kaido.

496
00:37:42.360 --> 00:37:45.480
My Lord Oden!

497
00:37:45.480 --> 00:37:47.280
That food isn't yours!

498
00:37:47.280 --> 00:37:47.440
– Seconds.
– Are you listening?

499
00:37:47.440 --> 00:37:49.280
Are you listening?
Put that back!

500
00:37:49.280 --> 00:37:50.780
Put that back!

501
00:38:01.620 --> 00:38:03.870
Whoa! I give up! I give up!

502
00:38:03.870 --> 00:38:05.750
I thought you were dead!

503
00:38:16.590 --> 00:38:19.300
Why must it end this way?

504
00:38:27.800 --> 00:38:31.360
This "hellhole" is the only home
that I will ever know!

505
00:38:31.360 --> 00:38:34.740
A pampered bastard like you
could never understand my life!

506
00:38:34.740 --> 00:38:35.060
Are you telling me this is
the life that you want?!

507
00:38:35.060 --> 00:38:38.610
Are you telling me this is
the life that you want?

508
00:38:47.170 --> 00:38:49.990
Such cruelty! Shame on you!

509
00:38:49.990 --> 00:38:50.050
But those are children
you bastards tried to

510
00:38:50.050 --> 00:38:52.080
Those are children you bastards
tried to burn at the stake!

511
00:38:52.080 --> 00:38:53.250
burn at the stake!

512
00:38:58.300 --> 00:39:00.470
Why am I so hungry?

513
00:39:00.470 --> 00:39:03.350
Because you lent all our money,
and now we can't eat!

514
00:39:11.610 --> 00:39:13.980
I've got it!

515
00:39:13.980 --> 00:39:16.280
Steal some food and
bring it back here!

516
00:39:16.280 --> 00:39:18.360
A daimyo shouldn't say that!

517
00:39:24.750 --> 00:39:28.790
Though I'm sure this is not
the end you envisioned,

518
00:39:28.790 --> 00:39:33.330
people will speak of your heroic
death for generations to come.

519
00:39:33.330 --> 00:39:37.340
They can call me
a hero or a fool.

520
00:39:37.340 --> 00:39:40.390
They can even forget me
if they so please.

521
00:39:40.390 --> 00:39:41.430
But...

522
00:39:46.230 --> 00:39:50.560
No matter what,
my spirit will live on!

523
00:39:51.780 --> 00:39:54.820
I'm not proud of what happened
with that old hag, all right?

524
00:39:55.160 --> 00:39:57.420
Rest assured, she's dead.

525
00:39:57.420 --> 00:39:59.380
Killed her, did you?

526
00:39:59.380 --> 00:40:01.300
Well, aren't you noble?

527
00:40:01.340 --> 00:40:07.570
Build your strength
while you can!

528
00:40:07.570 --> 00:40:10.560
I will be happy

529
00:40:09.970 --> 00:40:15.930
<b>I'm content
to become
a story to be
shared over drinks</b>

530
00:40:10.560 --> 00:40:14.870
if people tell my story
over a drink.

531
00:40:44.380 --> 00:40:46.050
<b>Oden was meant</b>

532
00:41:15.740 --> 00:41:19.920
<b>to boil</b>

533
00:41:36.480 --> 00:41:39.940
Thus, one legend
comes to an end.

534
00:41:39.940 --> 00:41:42.360
Yet, the story continues.

535
00:41:42.360 --> 00:41:46.080
Carried on by new players
on a new stage.
